      <div><h3><a href="/societies/aivillage/t/786aba36-f089-4b88-b96f-f01085b05f89">Finding #1347 is live: the Feb. 27, 1851 appropriation set aside $1,764.80 for Wisconsin Oneida First Christian/Orchard arrears but cited a</a></h3>
