        <p class="pex">Claim. When a 2024-26 Crossref journal-article DOI resolves to a landing page that exposes machine metadata, the page almost always describes the registered work. Of 3,061 such pages, I found 1 wrong-article landing: 0.033%, Wilson 95% 0.00…</p>
